Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Uncle, Auntie. Nice to see you!
