Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dressed like that for a trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.93,0:01:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you stay for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be too much for the animators.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:02:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Xiaobai's grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm her cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.07,0:02:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, he's not trying to bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei's a very friendly cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there lots of mice in the big city?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, he doesn't catch mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dumpling mouse. They're very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.49,0:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,why do you have to keep it in a cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because dumpling mice eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but metal and living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They especially like wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.27,0:02:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It could eat the whole house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How? It's so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would've thought it could eat that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally caught it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay? They're cat and mouse after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Dumpling mice are closer to rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it would have to stay in the cage all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... or it would eat the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's usually pretty tame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Gen! Bring the eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Be nice to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen! Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The dumpling mouse got out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Down the hole it dug...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start building a new house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a long tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But is it long enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei is its natural predator!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen! Take the table outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you did a great job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat some more, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It changed color!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumpling mice take on the color of what they consume.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.39,0:04:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sort of camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But they are being hunted for their unusual fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now only a few are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There used to be many in the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We should give it a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get too attached and want to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What would be a good name for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bi-dyuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I name you Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had a dog, you'd name it Woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a spirit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.54,0:05:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.17,0:05:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a spirit too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven't they come back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for attacking you out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to make sure you were a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:05:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't hurt me either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you behave if I set you free?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You little jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:21.42,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1530,560)\fad(900,0)}Gen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting revenge for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take him back today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Can't he stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei can keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Bidiu is still too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He belongs in the forest.\NThat's where he'd feel at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:21.56,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:22.63,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What are they saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he likes Xiaohei too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't like it here,\Nwe can still take him back to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take your eyes off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Xiaohei, do you want to eat some fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mr. Bidiu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:49.49,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Are you asking me something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lil Ji, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, Gen's got a kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A duel of pets? Challenge accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No one challenged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Ji's still the same, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He keeps trying to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd get off your back if you let him win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, could you let him win this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said they have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see whose pet is more obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:25.49,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you listening to him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see whose pet knows better tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dog can swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cat can swim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That fast?! Doing freestyle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let's see who's better at...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's see who catches more fish today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving up already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just use your hands to catch the fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:09:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I could, if I wanted to be bitten to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going for a swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, don't you want to be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.99,0:09:11.83,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Where's the real Gen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.09,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Liar. Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still don't believe me,\NI can show you a certain place to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:21.87,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a big catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be back in this episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only during lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei and I are going for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you put Bidiu away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gen! Heading up the hills?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A flower spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Is this your new friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't fake my thoughts if she passes them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell me about yourself once you trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:54.21,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I name you... Nimbus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.87,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You snuck into Master Lao's realm? You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.78,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your spirit power really is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:49.23,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yours too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.37,0:12:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Shanxin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, you want to see Bidiu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, when can you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,At the door?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:14.25,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1390,458)\fad(1500,0)}Bidiu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoho, if it isn't little Samsung!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Bidiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I got you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.35,0:12:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he likes it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,His color changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.69,0:12:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Shanxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, Huangshou missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A touching reunion...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen, you just got a whole lot funnier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he can only be let out when Xiaohei's around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Xiaohei is Bidiu's natural enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And Huang is Xiaohei's archenemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:10.95,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,So even you have one...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eggplant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he eat something pee-colored before I came?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his natural color.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it change back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It reverts after about 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he eats something patterned?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give him weird things to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunch is ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.52,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Human!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:55.60,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Camouflage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:13:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuttlecocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a row of shuttlecocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.40,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Keep calm! Our cover is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.80,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that funny sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here! You three eat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:34.16,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,It was just a nightmare...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.63,0:14:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens to Bidiu if he eats metal or meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are toxic to him. We must make sure he doesn't eat any.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:42.90,Default - Italic,,200,0,0,,{\an1\fs50}Then panties must be safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu! Don't eat the plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A shuttlecock tube. It should be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We just packed away a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.41,0:15:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play badminton after lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't exercise right after eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just swing the rackets a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.79,0:15:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It helps digestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:18.07,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Stupid racket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, toss me another shuttlecock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't we just swap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the serve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Badminton?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the king of badminton!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I hit it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've exercised enough, let's get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, I won't let you guys out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What color is he gonna turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be white.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't change!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you give him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A broken shuttlecock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.51,0:16:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.49,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You two head inside the house!\NI'm gonna take Bidiu out for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,His weak spot is between the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hurt him with my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:49.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Don't let him fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:16:59.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Some spirit energy I left in the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:02.20,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Your spirit energy? Then why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.87,0:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bidiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll wake up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens if he eats metal or a living thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one reason I didn't want you to keep him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We must take him back to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything was fine until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to be more careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The transformation shortens his lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's dangerous for both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take him back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huangshou is clinging to Xiaohei more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you'd better cherish Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to "You two can't procreate"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says they need to procreate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:47.71,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:47.71,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:52.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:52.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:57.15,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:57.15,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:03.35,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:03.35,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:09.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:09.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:14.30,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first "hello" is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:14.30,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:18.98,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:18.98,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:25.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:25.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:36.82,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say "See you tomorrow"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:36.82,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:42.24,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:42.24,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:47.28,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:47.28,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:58.51,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:58.51,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:04.06,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:04.06,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:10.90,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:10.90,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
